# Failing-first relaunch replay in tests/fm-spawn-relaunch-live-clone.test.sh: a ship recorded in an older same-origin clone, its tmux pane standing in its claimed old-pool slot, relaunches onto a leased live-pool slot at the same branch head (pane told to cd there, claims moved, record naming the live clone); on the base it relaunches in the old clone's worktree, and at 9317a7cd the tmux pane is refused. A relaunch refusing after the move rolls it back, a different live branch is never overwritten, and an ssh and an https URL of one repository read as one origin; each fails at 9317a7cd.
